    {
      "file": "EventFlowMsg/Npc_Hylia_022_Shop_Child.msbt",
      "label": "Talk_04",
      "text": "Win {color:0}five times in a row{color:65535}, and I'll give you a\none-time prize: {color:0}Three Deku Nuts{color:65535}!{page}Guess wrong, though, and you're done. It's all down\nto your luck!"
    },
    {
      "file": "EventFlowMsg/Npc_Kokiri_Mido_Child.msbt",
      "label": "Talk_03",
      "text": "Hrmph! You'll never find the {color:0}Kokiri Sword{color:65535} I hid in {color:0}Goron\nCity{color:65535}! And without a {color:0}sword{color:65535} and a {color:0}shield{color:65535}, I won't let you\nthrough!"
    },
    {
      "file": "EventFlowMsg/Npc_Kokiri_Mido_Child.msbt",
      "label": "Talk_20",
      "text": "You'll never find the {color:0}Kokiri Sword{color:65535} I hid in {color:0}Goron City{color:65535}!\nHrmph!{page}Bring both a {color:0}sword{color:65535} and a {color:0}shield{color:65535}, and then I'll let you pass!"
    },
