      "file": "EventFlowMsg/Npc_Kokiri_Mido_Child.msbt",
      "label": "Talk_26",
      "text": "But that's not enough! You still need a {color:0}sword{color:65535}, and you'll\nnever find the {color:0}Kokiri Sword{color:65535} I hid in {color:0}Goron City{color:65535}!"
